<statement>
<p>Find the volume of the figure below. All measurements are in inches. Round accordingly.</p>
<image width="52%" pi:generated="problems/images/mom-901726-1"/>
<p><fillin characters="5"/> <m>{in}^{3}</m></p>


</statement>
<answer>
<p><ul><li>210</li></ul></p>
</answer>
<solution><p>One way to calculate this volume is to calculate the volume of two boxes and add them.</p>
<p>
  <m>\displaystyle{\left({4}\right)}{\left({6}\right)}{\left({3}\right)}={72}</m></p>
<p>
  <m>\displaystyle{\left({4}\right)}{\left({7}\right)}{\left({5}\right)}={140}</m></p>
<p>
  Total volume is <m>\displaystyle{72}+{140}={212}\approx{210}</m>.</p></solution>
